Select the title line **Marriage, Family, and Kinship in Cameroon** (click in it, or triple-click). Then:

- *Home* > **Center** (shortcut Ctrl+E): the title is centred between the left and right margins (never with the space bar);
- in the *Font Size* box choose **13**;
- click **Bold** (shortcut Ctrl+B).

*Marking idea (2 marks):* title centred (1); size 13 and bold (1).
